      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if the option \"research schedule directly\" is selected, then the action to be taken is \"Research schedule\"",
        "If the option is not selected, then \"provide indications\" and proceed with the research schedule."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the initial XOR decision on the option. Guards abstract 'selected/not selected' to v1='Yes'/'No', which preserves the branching logic. Actions cover both paths including providing indications and proceeding with research schedule. Splitting the 'proceed with research' into a separate node (n5) is a harmless modeling choice."
